But you also get an anticipated revenue that adds to that on that sheet.

1036
01:15:24,480 --> 01:15:32,480
So if you're returning to and you have to have 2 million dollars in an anticipated revenue, now you're removing 4 million.

1037
01:15:32,480 --> 01:15:41,480
So it's all it's numbers, but they're close numbers and the even numbers and they stay even keeled.

