2099
02:48:02,020 --> 02:48:10,020
So I'm trying to balance acquiring enough of those different fractional sizes to be able to keep up with the needs of the students.

2100
02:48:10,020 --> 02:48:15,020
We're in the process of updating our mobile percussion instruments.

2101
02:48:15,020 --> 02:48:20,020
